ntents:\n      bin:\n        - bw\n\nabout:\n  homepage: https://bitwarden.com/help/cli/\n  license: GPL-3.0-only\n  license_file:\n    - LICENSE.txt\n    - LICENSE_GPL.txt\n    - THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.txt\n  summary: \"A secure and free password manager for all of your devices.\"\n  description: |\n    `bw` is the command-line interface to a Bitwarden vault. It logs in and\n    unlocks a vault, then creates, reads, edits and deletes items, folders,\n    attachments and organization collections, either interactively or as JSON\n    on stdin and stdout for scripting. It also generates passwords, imports\n    and exports vault data, sends and receives Bitwarden Sends, and can serve\n    a local REST API for other tools to query.\n  documentation: https://bitwarden.com/help/cli/\n  repository: https://github.com/bitwarden/clients/tree/main/apps/cli\n\nextra:\n  recipe-maintainers:\n    - phreed\n",
